  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=9033af&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"模组概述\"></p>\n<p>本模组支持 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也可仅安装于服务端。1.20.4 版本后已停止对 Forge 的支持。</p>\n<h3>简介</h3>\n<p>Moog's End Structures 为末地维度注入了新的活力，引入了一系列能完美融入现有地貌的新结构。每个结构都经过精心打造，使用原版方块和实体，保留经典的 Minecraft 风格。探索末地时，你将面临独特的挑战、强大的敌人以及丰厚的战利品。本模组兼容任何整合包，并可与 Moog's Voyager Structures (MVS) 共存，带来更丰富的游戏体验。加入 Moog's End Structures，深入末地，发现等待你的隐藏宝藏吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"实时预览所有结构的 3D 模型\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我们的主结构模组 MVS，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fmes-moogs-end-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ApCtgr7.png\" alt=\"MinecraftStorage\"></a></p>\n<div><h3><strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 兼容性数据包</h3><br><div>我为 Moog's End Structures 制作了一个专门的兼容性数据包，以增强其与热门模组 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 的整合效果。该数据包将我们部分现有结构的样式替换为 BOP 的方块，在安装双模组时提供更连贯、更具沉浸感的体验。你可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mes-biomes-o-plenty-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>找到并下载该兼容性数据包。</div></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>配置包</h3>\n<p>模组的各个方面均可通过数据包进行自定义。带有完整说明的模板可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mes-moogs-end-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>获取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"功能特色\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/YPIvnN1.png\" alt=\"合集\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"实机展示\"></p>\n<h3>视频</h3>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gqCYji1o2Xs?wmode=transparent&start=102\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1XGKnGel1oI?wmode=transparent&start=239\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/khBGeEdrWuc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>整合包</h3>\n<p>查看所有整合包<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d46028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"DISCORD\"></p>\n<p>获得回复的最佳且最快的方式是加入我们的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"BH 赞助\"></a></p>",
